      "locked": false,
      "text": "WAP to create class Emp with fields id, name and salaray.\n\n1. id should be autogenerated.\n\n2. id should be start from 1 and gradually increase.\n\n3. There should not be any gap.\n\nconstructor/methods:\n\n1. Paramaterized constructor takes two arg name and salary.\n\n2. Method showNextId to display id of next employee.\n\n3. Method displayEmp to display employe detail.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WAP to create class Emp with fields id, name and salaray.\n\n1. id should be autogenerated.\n\n2. id should be start from 1 and gradually increase.\n\n3. There should not be any gap.\n\nconstructor/methods:\n\n1. Paramaterized constructor takes two arg name and salary.\n\n2. Method showNextId to display id of next employee.\n\n3. Method displayEmp to display employe detail.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
